# The rules clew applies, and how much each matters.
#
# Pinned so a change to the set is visible in review rather than only in a
# diff of match arms. `the_rule_pack_matches_its_snapshot` compares it, and the
# pack version below is what a finding is cited against: raise it when a line
# under it changes, never for a wording fix.

pack core 2

invisible-unicode high core
opaque-hook medium core
download-and-execute high core
decode-and-execute high core
credential-exfiltration high core
unverified-download medium core
unpinned-remote-package low core
bypass-permissions high core
unrestricted-shell medium core
trusted-server medium core
plaintext-transport medium core
